# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build outputs - never commit our own compiled binaries; the curated release
# zip and the vendored third-party BepInEx payload (see exceptions at the end)
# are the only binaries that are versioned.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
out/
bin/
obj/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.cache
*.so
*.dylib
*.pyc
__pycache__/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local machine configuration (contains an absolute path to your game install)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GameDir.local.props
GameDir.local.txt
CPPFARMER_GAME.local.*
.env
.env.local

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime diagnostics written next to the installed plugin
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
bp_debug.txt
last_generated.py
doc_last.md
cpp_unlocks.txt
cppfarmer_reference.md
BepInEx/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reverse-engineering artefacts - NEVER COMMIT THESE
#
# This repository must not contain decompiled game source, IL disassembly,
# metadata dumps, extracted game assemblies, or the one-off analysis scripts
# used during development. See README.md "声明 / Notice".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
decomp/
decompiled/
out_core.txt
out_*.txt
*.il
*.asm
*.dump
*.decompiled.*
tools/dump_meta.py
tools/dump_sig.py
tools/dump_il.py
ILSpy/
ilspy_output/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.user

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Release output - NOT versioned.
#
# The release zip and the bundled BepInEx payload are build artifacts; publish
# them as a GitHub Release asset instead of committing them. Note: the payload
# source used by scripts/pack.py lives under dist/CppFarmer-mod/, so a fresh
# clone cannot rebuild the zip without downloading BepInEx 5.4.23.6 separately.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/dist/
